    "text": "Who We Are: F.S. Edmonds Elementary School is a Community School, serving 370+ students across grades K-8. It collaborates with the City of Philadelphia, the School District, community-based organizations, and the residents of Philadelphia to pave the way for student success. | What We Do: Our students are supported by a Community School Coordinator. Volunteers are needed to distribute groceries to students and families (weekly), support special events (occasionally), and more. Scroll down to Program Opportunities to get involved today! Looking to sign up for Philly Reading Coaches shifts at..."
